<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Unocal on Prudential list.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Unocal on Prudential list.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Prudential Securities added Unocal Corp to its Single Best Idea list and maintained its buy rating, a Prudential source said.</p>
<p>-- The source said the firm also raised its fourth-quarter earnings estimate to $0.35 from $0.30.</p>
<p>-- The stock rose 3/8 to 39-1/8.</p>
</text>
